values ('b3c4d5e6-7f8a-4b18-9c07-1d2e3f4a5b08', 'hospitality-strategic-management', 'Hospitality Strategic Management', 'This senior capstone integrates hospitality marketing, finance, accounting, operations, people, technology, real estate, law, and communication. Students diagnose industries and enterprises, evaluate resources and business models, choose competitive and corporate strategies, assess ownership and global-growth options, connect strategy to valuation and capital allocation, govern innovation and AI, design resilient and sustainable operating models, and lead implementation. A case-based strategy challenge culminates in a board-ready memo, analytical exhibits, presentation, and defense.');

